# Action buttons

Primary CTAs use the **black action button** (Sign in / Continue style): `#111111` background, white text, 52px min-height, 16px radius.

## Use `AppActionButton`

Default component for primary actions in the app shell, sheets, and footers:

```vue
<AppActionButton @click="onSubmit">Continue</AppActionButton>
```

- [`app/components/AppActionButton.vue`](app/components/AppActionButton.vue) — canonical implementation
- [`OnboardingFooterCta`](app/features/onboarding/components/OnboardingFooterCta.vue) — thin wrapper for onboarding pages (same styling)

Props: `disabled`, `loading`, `type` (`button` | `submit`), `block` (default `true`).

## Do not use for primary CTAs

```vue
<!-- BAD: purple primary is not the action button style -->
<v-btn color="primary" variant="flat">Continue</v-btn>

<!-- BAD: raw class when AppActionButton fits -->
<v-btn class="jobs-hub-cta">Continue</v-btn>
```

`jobs-hub-cta` is a legacy alias — prefer `AppActionButton` (applies `auth-cta-btn` internally).

## Secondary / tertiary actions

- **Secondary:** `variant="outlined"` or dashed placeholder buttons
- **Tertiary / skip:** `variant="text"`, muted foreground
- **Toolbar chips:** small tonal/outlined `v-btn` — not full action buttons

## Tokens

Defined in [`app/assets/css/main.css`](app/assets/css/main.css):

- `--auth-cta: #111111`
- `--auth-cta-hover: #2b2b2b`
- `--auth-cta-foreground: #ffffff`
- `--auth-radius-button: 16px`

Styled via `.auth-cta-btn` in [`app/assets/css/vuetify-overrides.css`](app/assets/css/vuetify-overrides.css). Applied globally (not layout-scoped) so portaled bottom sheets and dialogs get the same style.
